{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>פקד פקדתי אתכם</b> — as the numerical value of פקוד, defective — 'I have withheld from you,' from the language of ולא נפקד ממנו איש.'" "<b>העשוי</b> — two times in the Masorah: ואת העשוי לכם במצרים, and the other: כל הזהב העשוי למלאכה — for all the gold that came to them in Egypt, they would designate for the work of the Tabernacle."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:47.935073693Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}